## Dependency hygiene

- **`npm audit` runs in `/wire-check`.** Critical or high severity = BLOCKING. Moderate/low = WARN with a note in `artifacts/qa-reports/`.
- **No `--force` installs** to bypass peer-dep conflicts unless Tech Lead approves and documents in `artifacts/docs/changelog.md`.
- **Lockfile committed.** `package-lock.json` (or `pnpm-lock.yaml` if pnpm) is part of every change. CI must use `npm ci`, not `npm install`, to guarantee lockfile fidelity.
- **No script-running install hooks** from unfamiliar packages. Review `postinstall` scripts in `npm ls --all --json` if anything looks unfamiliar.

